
### get token 
POST {{base_url}}/v1/account/tokens
Content-Type: {{content_type_json}}

{
  "identification": "test",
  "password": "pwd",
  "category": "email"
}

### update password
PUT {{base_url}}/v1/account/password
Content-Type: {{content_type_json}}

{
  "historyId":242,
  "code":"301316",
  "password":"kkkk"
}